      "description": "Recovery. Strain. Sleep. Readiness — from the Apple Watch you already wear.\n\nCorrelate turns your Apple Health data into the daily recovery, strain and sleep scores you'd expect from a dedicated fitness band or smart ring — with no extra hardware to buy, no monthly subscription, and your health data never leaving your iPhone.\n\n◈ YOUR DAILY READINESS\nOne verdict each morning: push today, or back off and recover.\n• Recovery, Strain & Sleep — three scores, one glance\n• Health Score that shows what went into it\n• Stress Load, daily energy, HRV resilience & Biological Age\n• Sleep stages (REM, Deep, Core), sleep debt and consistency\n\n◈ ALREADY WEAR A RING OR A STRAP? BRING IT ALL TOGETHER\n• Import your Oura and WHOOP official exports — parsed entirely on-device, no account linking\n• Garmin and other watches that sync to Apple Health are picked up automatically\n• One place for every source and every score, and your history stays yours if you ever cancel a membership\n\n◈ FIND WHAT ACTUALLY MOVES YOUR NUMBERS\nDoes late caffeine wreck your sleep? Does a hard run lift tomorrow's HRV?\n• A 20-second daily journal: a few yes/no questions you chose\n• With vs. Without: how your recovery really looked on days you did a habit vs. days you didn't\n• Auto-Discovery scans for real correlations (Pearson r), including delayed effects up to 7 days out — labeled as patterns, never as proof\n\n◈ BUILT FOR PEOPLE WHO READ THE NUMBERS\n• Pro-grade stats: median, standard deviation, variability, trends and outliers\n• Dual-axis charts and scatter plots you can interrogate\n• A plain-English coach that shows its work, generated on your iPhone\n\n◈ NO SUBSCRIPTION. NO NEW WEARABLE. TOTAL PRIVACY.\n• One-time purchase — no monthly fees, ever\n• Works with the Apple Watch and iPhone you already own\n• 100% on-device analysis — no account, and your health data never leaves your phone. Anonymous, non-personal usage statistics only.\n\nStop renting your health insights. Own them.\n\nRequires an iPhone with Apple Health data. An Apple Watch is recommended for recovery, strain, heart-rate and sleep metrics.",
